{"title": "Multiattack (Shadow Druid)", "pageid": 44046, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack_(Shadow_Druid)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Ranged weapon attacks"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the extra attack action used by some NPCs. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Multiattack (disambiguation)\">Multiattack (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranged_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Ranged_Attack.webp/300px-Ranged_Attack.webp, /w/images/b/bd/Ranged_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Ranged_Attack.webp/300px-Ranged_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Ranged_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Multiattack (Ranged)</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon action</a> that is used by several <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Druids\" title=\"Shadow Druids\">Shadow Druids</a>. It is a free attack that can be performed after making another attack, akin to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nMake an additional ranged attack with your equipped weapon.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt>Damage</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Normal weapon damage</div></div></div></dd>\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ranged Weapon Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Ranged Weapon <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_ExtraAttack</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_ExtraAttack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_ExtraAttack\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CanDualWield_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CanDualWield (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CanDualWield</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsAttack_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsAttack (spell flag)\">IsAttack</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Pinta\" title=\"Pinta\">Pinta</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Olodan\" title=\"Olodan\">Olodan</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This seems to be an early implementation of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> since the name is <code>Projectile_ExtraAttack</code> and the action is a free attack usable only after performing another attack.</li>\n<li>This action is unusable except by the AI. If one the druids with this action is reanimated with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animating_Spores\" title=\"Animating Spores\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Animating_Spores_Icon.webp/20px-Animating_Spores_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Animating_Spores_Icon.webp/30px-Animating_Spores_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Animating_Spores_Icon.webp/40px-Animating_Spores_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animating Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Animating_Spores_Icon.webp/20px-Animating_Spores_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Animating_Spores_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animating_Spores\" title=\"Animating Spores\">Animating Spores</a>, it will be under direct control of the party. In this case, the attack will be unusable since it cannot target anything.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715095708\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2574/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32960/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11023/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1242602/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.014      1 -total\n 98.99%   53.470      1 Template:Feature_page\n 87.27%   47.135     31 Template:Trim\n 25.50%   13.775      3 Template:SmSAI\n 20.37%   11.000      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 18.00%    9.725      6 Template:Icon_text\n 15.23%    8.229      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 12.86%    6.944      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.28%    6.633      3 Template:Icon_link\n  9.52%    5.144      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:44046-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715095708 and revision id 293505. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}